<title>USA: CNB Bancshares votes stock dividend.</title>
<headline>CNB Bancshares votes stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>EVANSVILLE, Ind. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CNB Bancshares Inc said Tuesday its board voted a five percent stock dividend payable October 11, record September 20.</p>
<p>It said directors also expressed their intention of increasing CNB's fourth quarter 1996 cash dividend when it is declared in October. At the proposed rate of $0.22 per share, the cash dividend will effectively be increassed by 10 percent due to the stock dividend.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
